  "description_short": "Central George hangout serving crowd-pleasing burgers, grills and pub fare in a relaxed, friendly atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "Tucked into York Street in the heart of George, The Bench Eatery & Bar has earned its reputation as a reliable local favourite. The menu leans into hearty pub classics—think juicy burgers, flame-grilled steaks, and generous platters—perfect for a casual lunch or evening out with friends. The vibe is unpretentious and welcoming, with a bar that draws both regulars and visitors looking for a comfortable spot to unwind.\n\nWhether you're stopping in for a quick bite between meetings or settling in for a few drinks and a meal, The Bench delivers consistent, satisfying food without pretension. The central location makes it an easy choice when you're in town, and the friendly service keeps people coming back. It's the kind of place where you know what you're getting, and that's exactly the point.",
